      "message": "An alternate formulation that I think might be simpler but have the same benefit:\n* `pe_set_ado` returns `EC_SUCCESS` if the port is not connected.\n* `pd_send_alert_msg` only returns `EC_ERROR_BUSY` if `pe_set_ado` returned that.\n* Neither `pd_send_alert_msg` nor `pd_broadcast_alert_msg` needs to check explicitly if the port is connected.",
